! `doc/api-nesting-proposal.md` has been either applied or moved to its "Reviewed and kept
! top-level" list.
@ 0 4 0 153039203ba264620a4145959946ed5e
+ 完成条件：没有名称由多于一个库导出到 `package soundness` 中，不存在仅为规避冲突而设的 `@unexported`，且 `etc/api-nesting-proposal.md` 中 R8 表的每一行都已应用，或已移入其“Reviewed and kept top-level”列表。
